\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391130/extras/eccf5e5905993f5fdc029ac43973e27c.mp4?t=1745393098\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Innovative Movement:</strong></i> With no legs, you must leave your wheelchair behind at times, crawling into tight spaces and hidden areas to escape danger and solve intricate puzzles. Your vulnerability is your greatest challenge, but also your advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391130/extras/c7291b51a744f3e9941caf1d69f0501c.poster.avif?t=1745393098\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391130/extras/c7291b51a744f3e9941caf1d69f0501c.webm?t=1745393098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Immersive Gameplay:</strong></i> Solve complex puzzles, create diversions using items like bricks, and master stealth mechanics to evade the cybernetic monster that hunts you relentlessly.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you escape the nightmare before it consumes you? Only the strongest will survive in <strong>SHOCK</strong>.</p>",
